{"availability":"available","full":"Mylittlestories/pizzabox","name":"pizzabox","description":"🍕 Send the whole box, peer-to-peer. Drop many files or text, share one link — data goes straight browser-to-browser over WebRTC. No servers. Inspired by FilePizza.","category":"Other","language":"JavaScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-09-27T06:33:54Z","updated":"2026-09-27T06:40:28Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://mylittlestories.github.io/pizzabox/","topics":["file-sharing","file-transfer","filepizza","github-pages","javascript","no-server","p2p","peer-to-peer","peerjs","privacy","send-files","serverless","static-site","webrtc"],"demo":"https://mylittlestories.github.io/pizzabox/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T20:10:29.712Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T20:10:29.712Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T20:10:29.712Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T20:10:29.712Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Drop as many files as you like (or paste some text), get one share link — a 4-character code + QR — and it travels directly from your browser to the recipient's over WebRTC. Nothing is stored on any server.","Inspired by the delightful simplicity of FilePizza — rebuilt as a 100% static site so it can be hosted anywhere (GitHub Pages, Netlify, an S3 bucket, or just opened locally)."],"features":["Multi-file by default — send any number of files together in one link.","Drag & drop files or whole folders (folders are flattened automatically).","Text / snippet mode — share a message, link, or code block instead of files.","True peer-to-peer — bytes go browser → browser over an encrypted WebRTC data channel (DTLS). Only a tiny signaling handshake uses the free public PeerJS broker.","No server storage, no size caps, no sign-up."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Mylittlestories/pizzabox/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"276ccf39c574eef3a3ed79171105eeb884598b5f232e64ded60f